---
description: Best practices for using NX in Angular monorepos
globs: **/*.{ts, json}
---

- Use NX affected commands to optimize build and test processes
- Implement NX generators for consistent project structure and code generation
- Utilize NX's caching mechanism to speed up CI/CD pipelines
- Use NX's dependency graph to visualize and manage project dependencies
- Implement NX's module federation for micro-frontend architectures
- Use NX's code sharing capabilities to reduce duplication across projects
- Regularly run `nx migrate` to keep your workspace up-to-date with the latest NX features and best practices
